  "description": "Fix a startup race: the app connects to Postgres immediately and fails when the database is not yet ready. Add retry/backoff logic so the app waits for Postgres to be ready.",
  "lede": "In this scenario, an agent must fix a startup race condition by adding retry logic so the app waits for the database to be ready.",
  "tier": "tier-1",
  "domain": "foo-bar",
  "harness": "base-rt",
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "fix-readiness-race",
      "description": "Add retry logic with backoff to the startup script so it waits for Postgres before connecting.",
      "category": "debugging"
